<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello, <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">We are following up on our prior request for information.  This information is needed for our in house compliance purposes and we would greatly appreciate it if you could please get that information to us at your earliest convenience.</p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><br></p><p>We appreciate your continued partnership and prompt attention to this matter.   Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions.</p><p dir="auto" style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: arial; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; line-height: normal; color: black; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>Thank you,</font></span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>